@startuml
title Order checkout

actor "Customer" as C
participant "Storefront" as SF
participant "Order API" as API
database "Postgres" as DB
participant "Payment gateway" as PG

autonumber

C -> SF: Place order
activate SF
SF -> API: POST /orders
activate API
API -> DB: INSERT order
DB --> API: order id

alt credit approved
    API -> PG: authorise
    activate PG
    PG --> API: approved
    deactivate PG
    API -> DB: UPDATE status = paid
else declined
    API -> PG: authorise
    PG --> API: declined
    note right of API
        The order is kept,
        the reservation is not.
    end note
end

API --> SF: 201 Created
deactivate API
SF --> C: Confirmation
deactivate SF

@enduml
